{
  "_doc": "Tier-1 trapper's cabin in the forest above the Tamsin (region D6). A 7x5 one-room board cabin with a lean-to, smokehouse, meat cache, smoking rack and outhouse in the yard (structure props). Route: the path from the river ends at the front door, boarded from outside with the Rasks' warning on it -> round the side, where the wall under the lean-to is clawed through (a bear trap on the corner) -> inside, the dragger by the hole and three more held where they fell (taking the journal, unbolting the back door or opening the cache wakes them) -> the cache at the foot of the bunk is locked -> slide the back door bolt (shortcut) -> the key on its nail at the smokehouse door (a second set in front of it) -> back in to open the cache. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
